= Election Irregularities

Staal has made it clear he won’t establish a military dictatorship—after all, how could the <span style="color: #0A3161;">Western</span> <span style="color: #C8102E;">Allies</span> trust us if he can’t even maintain the façade of democracy? But that won’t stop him from meddling in our democratic processes, or so our informants claim. We have proof that Staal has funneled significant state funds to the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>.

Maybe Staal hasn’t done anything at all, and this is just the paranoia of the anti-Staal factions within the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> trying to sabotage our cooperation.

Either way, it’s given fresh ammunition to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>'s "old guard," who now demand the party sever ties with him before we become complicit in the slow destruction of the Unity Republic we helped build.

- @schleicher_1: Nonsense!
- @schleicher_2: There may be truth to their claim...

@schleicher_1
