We have publicly broken with Staal, presenting the frankly thin evidence to the public—including a shady 3-million Gold donation to the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>.

Staal dismisses it as simple politics, but many voters aren’t convinced. They’re rallying behind us as *the* democratic choice, now alert to democratic backsliding.